<title>USA: Strategic Minerals elects three new directors.</title>
<headline>Strategic Minerals elects three new directors.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategic Minerals or Stratcor, has named three new directors, Roman Friedrich of Dominion Bank, Lawrence Nkabinde of Dental Associates, and John Sipple of Business Resource Network.</p>
<p>Privately-held Stratcor, based in Connecticut, is a vanadium producer with operations in the U.S. and South Africa.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
